# Services

<Callout type="warning">
This page is generated from `caddy_sites` in `inventory/host_vars/caddy/main.yml`.
Edit the inventory, not this file.
</Callout>

Every service is reached at `https://<name>.{{ caddy_domain }}`, proxied by Caddy.
Upstream addresses come from each host's `ansible_host`, so re-addressing a host
changes every route that points at it.

